# Anti-loop

If you rewrite the **same approach** twice without new evidence, **stop**. Ship the simplest correct version, or run the app / Maestro once. Do not invent refs or races in a loop.

Observers fire again after writes. A brief empty list before seed finishes is normal. Assert final state (`100 notes`), not first paint.
